{"about_the_game":"&quot;Petit Game Collection vol.1&quot; is a spin-off minigame collection of &quot;Needy Streamer Overload&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757490/extras/380a1f5cac5faeec2c5571b30d966fe0.avif?t=1768913102\" width=512 height=318 /></span><br><br>In Volume 1,<br>we are featuring 3 mini-games that receive inspiration<br>from good old retro bish\u014djo games!<br><br>There's just something about &quot;&quot;retro&quot;&quot; that you can't feel elsewhere...<br>So go give it a try!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Contents</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757490/extras/1055beaa19fbf27bcadd6880511596a7.avif?t=1768913102\" width=508 height=286 /></span><br><strong>\u25a0Ame's Happy Happy Dating Game</strong><br>A retro-style visual novel,<br>where you get to experience a rare date scene that can't be seen in the main game.<br>Take Ame to a nice place and give her the time of her life!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757490/extras/a257c80d532ecb807a17497e66ef1dd5.avif?t=1768913102\" width=614 height=344 /></span><br><strong>\u25a0Don't Die, Kangel!</strong><br>A rogue-like shooting game.<br>After ariving at the scene of everyone's favorite anime convention,<br>what awaited our lovely internet angel were some filthy otakus... ew!<br>It's an angel's job to keep herself and the convention filth-free, so get shooting with... huh?!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757490/extras/e95f8c0ea433ae86dd2088f115faec05.avif?t=1768913102\" width=576 height=364 /></span><br><strong>\u25a0Break Out Kangel</strong><br>A game for the cultured.<br>Oh no, our internet angel is stuck in some blocks!<br>Break the blocks to reveal... *cough* ...help her out!<br>*This mini-game can only be played in Japanese.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757490/extras/ac57ec52c2eaa0306925f7d9a75cf8cf.avif?t=1768913102\" width=540 height=314 /></span><br><strong>\u25a0KAngel's Room</strong><br>Full of staff comments and inside stories. A must read for NSO fans.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2757490?t=1768913102","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768913102","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768913102","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768913102","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains mild depictions of nudity as well as sexually suggestive behavior."},"detailed_description":"&quot;Petit Game Collection vol.1&quot; is a spin-off minigame collection of &quot;Needy Streamer Overload&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757490/extras/380a1f5cac5faeec2c5571b30d966fe0.avif?t=1768913102\" width=512 height=318 /></span><br><br>In Volume 1,<br>we are featuring 3 mini-games that receive inspiration<br>from good old retro bish\u014djo games!<br><br>There's just something about &quot;&quot;retro&quot;&quot; that you can't feel elsewhere...<br>So go give it a try!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Contents</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/27574